---
import { twoBasisDensityMatrix } from '../../../data/part04/ch15TeachingModels.mjs';

const componentId = 'ch15-density-matrix';
const defaults = { overlap: 0.25, angleDegrees: 35, occupation: 2 };
const initial = twoBasisDensityMatrix({ overlap: defaults.overlap, mixingAngle: defaults.angleDegrees * Math.PI / 180, occupation: defaults.occupation });
const matrix = initial.densityMatrix;
---

<figure class="chapter-visual density-matrix" id={componentId}>
  <figcaption>
    <strong>原创交互模型：nonorthogonal density matrix 与 Tr(PS)</strong>
    <span lang="en">Original interactive model: a nonorthogonal density matrix and Tr(PS)</span>
  </figcaption>

  <div class="chapter-visual__controls density-matrix__controls">
    <label>overlap s<input data-dm-overlap type="range" min="-0.6" max="0.6" step="0.02" value={defaults.overlap} /><output data-dm-overlap-output>{defaults.overlap.toFixed(2)}</output></label>
    <label>mixing angle θ<input data-dm-angle type="range" min="0" max="90" step="1" value={defaults.angleDegrees} /><output data-dm-angle-output>{defaults.angleDegrees}</output>°</label>
    <label>occupation f<input data-dm-occupation type="range" min="0" max="2" step="0.1" value={defaults.occupation} /><output data-dm-occupation-output>{defaults.occupation.toFixed(1)}</output></label>
  </div>

  <svg viewBox="0 0 720 330" role="img" aria-labelledby={`${componentId}-title ${componentId}-desc`}>
    <title id={`${componentId}-title`}>Coefficient vector, overlap matrix, and density matrix for a two-function model</title>
    <desc id={`${componentId}-desc`}>The coefficients are normalized with the overlap metric, and the electron count is the trace of the density matrix times the overlap matrix.</desc>
    <text x="130" y="38" text-anchor="middle">S</text>
    <rect class="dm-cell" x="60" y="55" width="70" height="70" /><rect class="dm-cell" x="130" y="55" width="70" height="70" />
    <rect class="dm-cell" x="60" y="125" width="70" height="70" /><rect class="dm-cell" x="130" y="125" width="70" height="70" />
    <text x="95" y="98" text-anchor="middle">1</text><text data-dm-s12 x="165" y="98" text-anchor="middle">{defaults.overlap.toFixed(2)}</text>
    <text data-dm-s21 x="95" y="168" text-anchor="middle">{defaults.overlap.toFixed(2)}</text><text x="165" y="168" text-anchor="middle">1</text>

    <text x="360" y="38" text-anchor="middle">C</text>
    <rect class="dm-cell" x="325" y="55" width="70" height="70" /><rect class="dm-cell" x="325" y="125" width="70" height="70" />
    <text data-dm-c0 x="360" y="98" text-anchor="middle">{initial.coefficients[0].toFixed(3)}</text>
    <text data-dm-c1 x="360" y="168" text-anchor="middle">{initial.coefficients[1].toFixed(3)}</text>

    <text x="585" y="38" text-anchor="middle">P=fCC†</text>
    <rect class="dm-cell dm-cell--density" x="515" y="55" width="70" height="70" /><rect class="dm-cell dm-cell--density" x="585" y="55" width="70" height="70" />
    <rect class="dm-cell dm-cell--density" x="515" y="125" width="70" height="70" /><rect class="dm-cell dm-cell--density" x="585" y="125" width="70" height="70" />
    <text data-dm-p00 x="550" y="98" text-anchor="middle">{matrix[0][0].toFixed(3)}</text>
    <text data-dm-p01 x="620" y="98" text-anchor="middle">{matrix[0][1].toFixed(3)}</text>
    <text data-dm-p10 x="550" y="168" text-anchor="middle">{matrix[1][0].toFixed(3)}</text>
    <text data-dm-p11 x="620" y="168" text-anchor="middle">{matrix[1][1].toFixed(3)}</text>

    <path class="dm-arrow" d="M215 125 H300" /><path class="dm-arrow" d="M405 125 H490" />
    <text x="360" y="245" text-anchor="middle">C†SC = 1</text>
    <text x="360" y="280" text-anchor="middle">electron count = Tr(PS)</text>
    <text data-dm-count x="360" y="312" text-anchor="middle" class="dm-count">{initial.electronCount.toFixed(6)}</text>
  </svg>

  <div class="chapter-visual__readout" aria-live="polite">
    <span>Tr(P)=<output data-dm-plain-trace>{(matrix[0][0] + matrix[1][1]).toFixed(5)}</output></span>
    <span>Tr(PS)=<strong data-dm-electron-count>{initial.electronCount.toFixed(6)}</strong></span>
    <span>P_12=<output data-dm-offdiag>{matrix[0][1].toFixed(5)}</output></span>
  </div>

  <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
    <p><strong>模型：</strong>two real basis functions with overlap matrix <code>[[1,s],[s,1]]</code>; one occupied state is normalized by <code>C†SC=1</code> and <code>P=fCC†</code>.</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Model:</strong> two real basis functions with overlap matrix <code>[[1,s],[s,1]]</code>; one occupied state is normalized by <code>C†SC=1</code> and <code>P=fCC†</code>.</p>
    <p><strong>验收：</strong>任意允许的 s、θ 和 f 都满足 <code>Tr(PS)=f</code>；仅在 <code>s=0</code> 等特殊情况下普通 <code>Tr(P)</code> 才等于 electron count。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Acceptance:</strong> every allowed s, θ, and f satisfies <code>Tr(PS)=f</code>; the ordinary <code>Tr(P)</code> equals the electron count only in special cases such as <code>s=0</code>.</p>
    <p><strong>边界：</strong>该 finite model 不代表 self-consistent density、spin degeneracy convention、finite-temperature occupations 或真实 basis functions。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Boundary:</strong> this finite model is not a self-consistent density, a spin-degeneracy convention, finite-temperature occupations, or a set of real basis functions.</p>
  </div>

  <noscript><p>无 JavaScript fallback：静态矩阵对应 s=0.25、θ=35°、f=2；metric normalization 和 Tr(PS) 关系仍可读取。</p></noscript>
</figure>

<script>
  import { twoBasisDensityMatrix } from '../../../data/part04/ch15TeachingModels.mjs';
  const root = document.getElementById('ch15-density-matrix');
  if (root) {
    const overlap = root.querySelector('[data-dm-overlap]');
    const angle = root.querySelector('[data-dm-angle]');
    const occupation = root.querySelector('[data-dm-occupation]');
    const fields = Object.fromEntries(Array.from(root.querySelectorAll('[data-dm-s12],[data-dm-s21],[data-dm-c0],[data-dm-c1],[data-dm-p00],[data-dm-p01],[data-dm-p10],[data-dm-p11],[data-dm-count],[data-dm-overlap-output],[data-dm-angle-output],[data-dm-occupation-output],[data-dm-plain-trace],[data-dm-electron-count],[data-dm-offdiag]')).map((item) => [item.getAttributeNames().find((name) => name.startsWith('data-dm-')), item]));
    if (overlap instanceof HTMLInputElement && angle instanceof HTMLInputElement && occupation instanceof HTMLInputElement) {
      const set = (key, value) => { const item = fields[key]; if (item instanceof HTMLOutputElement) item.value = value; else if (item instanceof Element) item.textContent = value; };
      const update = () => {
        const s = Number(overlap.value), theta = Number(angle.value), f = Number(occupation.value);
        const result = twoBasisDensityMatrix({ overlap: s, mixingAngle: theta * Math.PI / 180, occupation: f });
        const P = result.densityMatrix;
        set('data-dm-s12', s.toFixed(2)); set('data-dm-s21', s.toFixed(2));
        set('data-dm-c0', result.coefficients[0].toFixed(3)); set('data-dm-c1', result.coefficients[1].toFixed(3));
        set('data-dm-p00', P[0][0].toFixed(3)); set('data-dm-p01', P[0][1].toFixed(3)); set('data-dm-p10', P[1][0].toFixed(3)); set('data-dm-p11', P[1][1].toFixed(3));
        set('data-dm-count', result.electronCount.toFixed(6)); set('data-dm-overlap-output', s.toFixed(2)); set('data-dm-angle-output', theta.toFixed(0)); set('data-dm-occupation-output', f.toFixed(1));
        set('data-dm-plain-trace', (P[0][0] + P[1][1]).toFixed(5)); set('data-dm-electron-count', result.electronCount.toFixed(6)); set('data-dm-offdiag', P[0][1].toFixed(5));
      };
      [overlap, angle, occupation].forEach((control) => control.addEventListener('input', update));
      update();
    }
  }
</script>

<style>
  .density-matrix__controls { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(12rem, 1fr)); gap: 0.8rem; }
  .density-matrix__controls label { display: grid; gap: 0.3rem; }
  .density-matrix input, .density-matrix svg { width: 100%; }
  .density-matrix svg text { fill: currentColor; font-size: 15px; }
  .dm-cell { fill: var(--sl-color-gray-6); stroke: var(--sl-color-accent-high); }
  .dm-cell--density { fill: var(--sl-color-gray-5); }
  .dm-arrow { stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 2; marker-end: none; }
  .dm-count { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; }
</style>
